  {
   "id": "worms-rumble-135554@major-2020-12-10",
   "gameId": "worms-rumble-135554",
   "displayName": "New Map Update - Deadly Docks Next Week + The Lab 'Pistols At Dawn' Live Today!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-12-10T13:53:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're thrilled to announce Deadly Docks our new map is coming to Worms Rumble next Thursday, December 17th! Also that The Lab opens at 3PM GMT today with the first gameplay experiment, 'Pistols at Dawn, where you can earn an exclusive gold skin for the event, but hurry, it closes in 48 hours!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Deadly Docks",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're shipping the new map, Deadly Docks next Thursday! Did anyone here guess this was the map from our teasers earlier in the week? Let us know in the comments below!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We invite you to engage in total seaside warfare in this new map! As a working dock it's a busy place with moving platforms and even a ship that can cast-off during the match... bon voyage!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Are you a captain or a shark?",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Take a bite out of these new purchasable premium outfits with a choice between a shark or captain outfit, both have 3 color variants included! Let us know which side you'll take!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ahoy",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chomp",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Festive Skins!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Are those bells we here? Or is it just festive cheer?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have a whole bunch of free festive skins to get your hands on for the holidays. Pull Santa's sleigh and put on one of the 3 variants of the Reindeer outfit!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Get your elf on the shelf with either a green or red outfit.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Plus open up a set of hats and a whole bunch of festive gun skins!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Duck!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "OK, now you need to run from that festive Hammerhead!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "More customisations?",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Also available to purchase will be the Armageddon weapon skin pack - feel some nostalgia from one of the favorite Worms titles.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Plus, purchase the emote pack and even teabag your enemies, of course we mean dipping a teabag into a mighty fine brew, get your mind out of the gutter!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Pistols At Dawn Event is Now LIve!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reward",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Get yourself that Midas touch feeling with the full body gold Worm experience. Nothing says bling-bling than covering yourself head to toe head to tail like lots of rare metal! This is an exclusive skin only available by playing in this event! You have 48 hours!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Balancing Changes Live",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Sentry Launcher",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Health increased from 30 to 50",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Targeting speed increased slightly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Damage increased from 5 to 8",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Accuracy increased slightly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Targeting range increased slightly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rocket Shield",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Health increased from 200 to 300 (Remember you can see the current health next to your reticule!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reload time reduced from 1.2 to 1.0",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Damage increased from 30 to 35",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Plasma Blaster",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where the input to charge up between shots could be missed, as a result increased the charge up time from 0.7 to 0.9 to balance out",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Slightly reduced projectile speed to allow more potential to be blocked with the Baseball Bat",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bazooka",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reload time increased from 0.75 to 0.9",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "QOL",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased player participation XP per match",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased weapon XP rewarded for time held and damage dealt (this should help with more passive weapons like shield/turrets)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor tweaks to drop rates across all weapon crates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "For now it's time to rumble!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Keep up to date with everything Worms Rumble in our socials",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twitter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Facebook",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
