  {
   "id": "worms-rumble-135554@major-2020-12-05",
   "gameId": "worms-rumble-135554",
   "displayName": "Worms Rumble Update - Main Crash Fix, New Content Tease and More!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-12-05T09:40:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We continue to be over the moon with the reception to Worms Rumble! Thanks to everyone who has picked it up so far and we hope you are having a blast! Here's another bunch of fixes based on some of the most reported and requested changes for the community. You can also see the patch from a couple of days ago which rebalanced weapons and reduced the load wait time here:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Main Crash Fix",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have had heaps of reports from players who selected 'close and submit' when they crashed, and from these we have a fix for the issue that was effecting the vast majority of players at the start of matches. Thanks again for all of your reports and we hope all of the people effected will have an even better time in Worms Rumble!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Firing Backwards Fix",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also have a fix for Worm aim direction desync which had caused players to fire backwards. Sorry for this quirk and hopefully all of your shots will now go where you're aiming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Achievement Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for Win Last Worm Standing trophy not being unlocked",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for Win Deathmatch trophy not being unlocked",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for Top 50 and Complete a match trophies not being unlocked correctly in Last Worm Standing and Last Squad standing gamemodes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fix a few rewards not unlocking properly",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Black & Gold crown is now correctly a reward instead of a level 48 unlock",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nuclear hoodie is now correctly a reward instead of a level 48 unlock",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ananas lids 10 gallon hat is now correctly a reward instead of a level 48 unlock",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Galvanized Steel Worm skin is now correctly unlocked at level 50",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're still looking into a few of the other highly reported issues and requests and there will be more frequent patches... on top of that we have some new content coming soon. Can you guess what it is?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
