       "text": "We'll be sure to tease the content update coming next week more very soon so keep a wormy eye out!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you all in the next patch, for now it's time to rumble!",
