  {
   "id": "worms-rumble-135554@major-2020-12-02",
   "gameId": "worms-rumble-135554",
   "displayName": "Worms Rumble Update - Loading Wait Time Reduced and Weapon Buffs!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-12-02T15:23:45.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Worms Rumble landed on Steam yesterday and we were thrilled to see so many playing the game! We've had some amazing feedback so far, and have a patch based on your suggestions alongside our observations so far. This update does not require an update and should automatically update whilst you are in-game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Weapon Buffs",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Revolver time between shots decreased from 0.25 to 0.2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Assault Rifle repeat fire time reduced from 0.2 to 0.15",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Shotgun time between shots decreased from 0.75 to 0.65",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sheep Launcher reload time reduced from 1.0 to 0.8",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rocket Shield reload time reduced from 1.5 to 1.2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rocket Shield fly time increased from 0.75 to 1.0",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "These changes follow nerfs made after beta feedback and have now been buffed slightly based on everyone's thoughts so far. Please let us know your thoughts on these weapons now, if they are too strong, too weak still or just right!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Quality of Life",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Match load time reduction",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have significantly reduced the wait times into a match, before even if everyone had connected it would wait 60 seconds total, this is now 20 seconds a third of the time spent in the loading screen as people get into the match. We hope this will make getting into new matches much snappier!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Next",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We continue to work on fixes for other issues reported by the community, please if you come across a crash use the 'submit and close' button to report them directly to us and also you can report any other issues to our support team in the report a problem section of our Steam forums.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you all in the next patch, for now it's time to rumble!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Keep up to date with everything Worms Rumble in our socials",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twitter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Facebook",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
